<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Down in the valley with my Savior I would go,</l><l>Where the storms are sweeping and the dark waters flow;</l><l>With His hand to lead me I will never, never fear,</l><l>Dangers cannot fright me if my Lord is near.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Down in the valley, or upon the mountain steep,</l><l>Close beside my Savior would my heart ever keep;</l><l>He will lead me safely in the path that He has trod,</l><l>Up to where they gather in the rest of God.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
